<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 6.57 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 6.57 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 6.57 percent in the week ending October 26 from 6.51 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES	 Oct 26	Oct 19     Oct 28, 1995</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change     +6.57	+6.51	   +8.59</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)   317.9	317.4	   298.3</p>
<p>Note - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended October 28, 1995.</p>
